# Product vision filter

Before proposing or implementing **substantial feature work**, read `docs/VISION.md`.

## Required checks

1. **Four questions** — at least one must be yes, or do not build.
2. **Do this, not that** — AI-assisted with override (not manual-first); unified coach home (not new tabs); parent features must feed coach retention.
3. **Anti-goals** — especially no gimmick chatbot; no parent-only features off the flywheel.
4. **Current state (July 2026)** — honest gap vs aspirational; don’t assume weekly coach habit exists yet.
5. **Schema rule** — sport-agnostic field names (`sport_type`, not `wrestling_level`) even when UI is wrestling-specific.

## Priority

Pillar #1 **Intelligent Coach Platform** > community > Guild Market. Coach OS intelligence > market listing AI.

When a request conflicts with `docs/VISION.md`, update the doc or label the work an explicit exception.
